      "standardized_narrative": "Opening gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2014 were GBP 554.9m. The syndicate reports a prioryear movement in the provision for claims amounting to a net decrease of GBP 18.0m (a release), equivalent to about 3.24% of opening gross reserves. The release is described as favourable claims development, reflecting improving attritional experience in reunderwritten books (notably Property-related binder business). Offsetting items in the year included significant aviation war losses (Tripoli Airport attack) and strengthening in the General Liability book, but overall prior years produced a net release.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "The change amounts to an decrease in 2014 of previous provisions of GBP 18.0m (2013: GBP 0.5m decrease).",
        "We are pleased to report a profit for the 2012 closed year of account with a return on capacity of 7.1%, as previously reported the 2012 year of account was materially impacted by Super storm Sandy in the last quarter of the 2012 calendar year.",
        "Following the decision in 2013 to change the underwriting strategy in the General Liability book the underwriting team left the Syndicate in 2014 and in the latter part of 2014 we recruited a new experienced team to take the account forward in a direction that will prove more profitable for the Syndicate. Given the increased loss experience in both this year and earlier years we have strengthened the reserving position on this account.",
